    "English word + grammar tag for every card. Hand-edited; tools/build.py merges it into the catalogue.",
    "w     : word spoken by the speech synthesiser (and used by the sentence generator)",
    "tag   : nouns -> animate (can be a subject) | place (goes after a blue dot) | thing | abstract (never generated)",
