    "pl    : plural form when it is not just word+s/es (e.g. fish, elves)",
    "nopl  : true = uncountable, never pluralised",
    "check : true = the picture was ambiguous, the teacher should confirm the word",
    "words : marker cards only -- the words the dot can stand for; tapping a placed dot cycles through them"
